    "text": "Eli Kalvelage wins boys 2-mile open at Bee Bee Invite on Aug. 29, 2026\nBee Bee Invite Boys XC OPEN 2 Miles on Aug. 29, 2026 was won by Eli Kalvelage in 12:42.21, according to RunSignUp results.\nKalvelage was listed as being from Gridley, Illinois.\nMaddox York finished second in 12:42.52, and Cruz Hitchens was third in 13:26.46.",
